(85, 'Amritpal Singh "AP" Dhillon (born January 10, 1993) is an Indo-Canadian singer-rapper and record producer associated with Punjabi music. Five of his singles have peaked on the Official Charts Company UK Asian and Punjabi charts, while "Majhail" and "Brown Munde" have topped Billboard charts. Dhillon, alongside his label-mates Gurinder Gill, Shinda Kahlon, and Gminxr, works as a group under their label, Run-Up Records.', '1993-01-10', 0),
