(128, 'Imlie (transl. Tamarind) is an Indian Hindi-language drama television series that aired from 16 November 2020 to 12 May 2024 on StarPlus and streamed on Disney+ Hotstar. The show was produced by Gul Khan under 4 Lions Films. One of the longest running Indian television soap opera, the series starred Sumbul Touqeer, Gashmeer Mahajani, Mayuri Deshmukh, Fahmaan Khan for the first generation, Megha Chakraborty, Karan Vohra, Seerat Kapoor as the second generation, Adrija Roy and Sai Ketan Rao for the third and final generation.

', NULL, 0),
