(306, 'Abi Sampa is a singer from London in the Indian classical tradition.  She appeared in The Voice UK in 2013.   She sings Qawwali, Carnatic and Western music.  She was the first singer from an Asian tradition to appear on The Voice. She and Rushil Ranjan formed Orchestral Qawwali in 2020.', NULL, 0),
(307, 'Dheekshitha Venkadeshan (born 26 June 1998), known professionally as Dhee, is an Australian singer known for her work as a playback singer in Indian cinema. She is best known for her collaborations with her stepfather, Santhosh Narayanan, and her distinctive alto voice. She won the Filmfare Award for Best Singer for “Kaattu Payale”, from the 2020 film Soorarai Pottru.', '1998-06-26', 0),
