(544, 'Alisha Chinai (born 18 March 1965) is an Indian pop singer known for her Indi-pop albums as well as playback singing in Hindi cinema. She began her singing career with the album Jadoo in 1985, and by the 1990s she had become known as the ''Queen of Indipop''. Her best known songs were with producers Anu Malik and Biddu during the 1990s. Her best known song is Made in India.

', '1965-03-18', 0),
