(1282, 'Arsh Muneer was a Pakistani actress and singer who acted in television dramas. She played roles in the PTV dramas Khuda Ki Basti, Shama, Shehzori, Zair, Zabar, Pesh, Intezar Farmaiye and Ana.', NULL, 0),
(1283, 'Attaullah Khan Niazi SI PP (born 19 August 1951), known professionally as Attaullah Khan Esakhelvi, is a Pakistani musician, singer, poet, and occasional actor from Isakhel in Mianwali District, Punjab. He is mainly associated with the folk music of Punjab and has written various songs and poems in the Saraiki language.
In 2011, he appeared on Coke Studio (season 4) and sang the songs Ni Oothaan Waale, and Pyaar Naal.
In September 2017, he appeared again in Coke Studio (season 10) and sang Sab Maya Hai with his traditional band.', '1951-08-19', 0),
