(1716, 'Krists Indrišonoks (born 27 February 1995), better known as Chris Noah, is a Latvian singer and songwriter. Noah won Album of the Year for Atvadas nav skumjas, ja zinām, ka drīz tiksimies, and Song of the Year for "Nomodā" at the 2025 Latvian Music Recording Awards. His single "Romance Isn''t Dead" finished 5th at the 2025 Supernova, which is used as the Latvian national selection for the Eurovision Song Contest.
His EPs include What about Tomorrow? (2017), Distance (2020) and Red Light (2022). He released his first full-length album Atvadas nav skumjas, ja zinām, ka drīz tiksimies in October 2024.', '1995-02-27', 0),

