(1806, 'Ikwinder Singh Sahota is a Canadian musician and record producer. He is associated with Punjabi music.  He has produced for a variety of artists notably Tory Lanez, Diljit Dosanjh, Sidhu Moose Wala, Shubh, Karan Aujla, Amrit Maan, Veet Baljit, Gurnam Bhullar, Himmat Sandhu, Garry Sandhu and Ammy Virk among others. His singles "Baller" with Shubh and "Chauffeur" with  Diljit Dosanjh and Tory Lanez charted on the Canadian Hot 100. His EP "Four You" with Karan Aujla peaked at No. 16 on the Billboard Canadian Albums Chart.', NULL, 0),
