(2131, 'This is a list of notable residents and people who have origins in the Sylhet Division of Bangladesh and the Barak Valley of the Indian state of Assam. This list also includes British Bangladeshis, Bangladeshi Americans, Bangladeshi Canadians, Bangladeshi Europeans and other non-resident Bengalis who have origins in Greater Sylhet. The people may also be known as Sylheti.', NULL, 0),

