(2342, 'Sanjeev–Darshan is a film song composer duo in the Bollywood film industry of India. The duo derives its name from the first names of its two principals, Sanjeev Rathod and Darshan Rathod. Sanjeev and Darshan are the sons of the late Hindi film song composer Shravan Rathod, who himself paired with music director Nadeem as all-time great music director duo Nadeem-Shravan. Their first released soundtrack was for the 1999 film Mann.', NULL, 0),
