(2346, 'Tulsi Kumar Dua popularly known as Tulsi Kumar, is an Indian playback singer, radio jockey, musician, and actress in the Bollywood industry. She was born to businessman Gulshan Kumar, the former owner of T Series who also worked as a singer, and his wife Sudesh Kumari. She is also the sister of film producer Bhushan Kumar and actress Khushali Kumar. She also owns Kids Hut, a YouTube channel owned by record label T-Series, featuring children''s content including nursery rhymes and stories.

', NULL, 0),
(2347, 'Darshana KT (born 6 November 1994) is an Indian Tamil playback singer, music composer and artist for films in India. She is currently residing in Chicago and shuttles between India and the US for her music projects.', '1994-11-06', 0),
