(2806, 'Vasantrao Deshpande (2 May 1920 – 30 July 1983)  was a Hindustani classical vocalist renowned for his contribution to Natyasangeet  (musical dramas).His play Katyar Kaljat Ghusli became very popular.', '1920-05-02', 0),
