(3149, 'Nanben Da is a 2017 Indian Tamil language comedy chat show which airs on Zee Tamil every Sunday at 1:30PM (IST) from 18 June 2017 to 10 December 2017 for 27 Episodes. The show was shift at 1:00PM (IST) The show''s anchors are  Smile Settai, and RJ Vigneshkanth.', NULL, 0),
