(3155, 'Songwrights Apothecary Lab is the eighth studio album by American bassist and singer Esperanza Spalding. Concord Records released the album on September 24, 2021.
The album debuted at number 11 on the US Billboard Contemporary Jazz Albums chart. At the 64th Annual Grammy Awards, the album won Best Jazz Vocal Album award.', NULL, 0),
