(3231, 'Navv Inder is an Indian R&B singer.  In collaboration with rapper Badshah, In 2016, his song "Wakhra Swag" won, PTC Punjabi Music Awards for the best duo/group and most popular song of the year.  "Wakhra Swag" had more than 260 million hits on YouTube in may 2020.', NULL, 0),
