(3549, 'Deep Jandu is a Canadian record producer, rapper and singer associated with Punjabi music. He is founder and CEO of the record label Royal Music Gang. Jandu released his debut album Nach in 2011. His song "Daru Daru" was well received by the audience. He was also nominated for Filmfare Awards Punjabi Best Music Album category for Channa Mereya (2017), along Gold Boy, Jaidev Kumar, and Sonu Ramgarhia.', NULL, 0),

