(3597, 'Murthy, Murthi, Murty, Murti or Moorthy, or similar variants, is a name from the South Indian states of Tamil Nadu, Andhra Pradesh, Karnataka, and Telangana. It is found commonly amongst Brahmins as a personal name or surname. It is often paired with names of Hindu gods and concepts, forming other names – e.g. Dakshinamurthy, Krishnamurthy, Satyamurthy, etc.
Notable people with the name include:', NULL, 0),
