(3689, 'Kullfi Kumarr Bajewala (native name Hindi: कुल्फ़ी कुमार बाजेवाला, transl. Kullfi Kumarr The Musician) is an Indian musical drama television series that aired from 19 March 2018 to 7 February 2020 on Star Plus. Produced by Gul Khan, Karishma Jain and Nilanjana Purkayasstha, it was directed by Pradeep Yadav and written by Sahana and Faizal Akhtar. The show starred Aakriti Sharma, Mohit Malik, Anjali Anand, Myra Singh, Shruti Sharma and Vishal Aditya Singh and was a remake of the Bengali television series Potol Kumar Gaanwala.
