(4101, 'Ashnoor Kaur (born 3 May 2004) is an Indian actress who primarily works in Hindi television. Kaur made her acting debut in 2009 with Jhansi Ki Rani. She is best known for her portrayal of Navika Vyas Bhatnagar in Na Bole Tum Na Maine Kuch Kaha, Naira Singhania in Yeh Rishta Kya Kehlata Hai, Mini Babita in Patiala Babes and Suman Sharma Mittal in Suman Indori. She is the recipient of an Indian Telly Award along with nominations for two ITA Awards. Kaur is currently a contestant in the Indian reality show, Bigg Boss 19.', '2004-05-03', 0),
