(4106, 'Stebin Ben (born 9 March 1993) is an Indian Playback, Pop singer and Live Performer. He is recognised for his versatile singing and melodious voice and has worked with some of the notable music directors and actors in Bollywood. Stebin Ben reached the masses with his viral songs Sahiba, Thoda Thoda Pyaar, Rula Ke Gaya Ishq  and few more. He performed at Anant Ambani’s Pre wedding and Sangeet which created a lot of buzz. He is a popular wedding performer  with more than 1000 shows all across the world.', '1993-03-09', 0),
