', '1980-11-23', 0),
(4451, 'Khushboo Grewal also known as Khushboo Kochhar is an Indian playback singer and actress. She began her career as a VJ on B4U and then moved to Punjabi and Hindi films as an actress. She has acted in movies  such as Raaz: The Mystery Continues and Punjabi films  such as Carry on Jatta. She is mostly known as a playback singer, was recognised for the Meet Bros composition "Pink Lips" from the Bollywood movie Hate Story 2 She is also a lead vocalist of the Meet Bros band.', NULL, 0),
