(4480, '2025 in film is an overview of events, including award ceremonies, festivals, a list of country- and genre-specific lists of films released, and notable deaths. Shochiku and Gaumont celebrated their 130th anniversaries, 20th Century Studios and Republic Pictures celebrated their 90th anniversaries, and Studio Ghibli celebrated its 40th anniversary. Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer''s first musical film The Broadway Melody (1929), known for being the first sound film to win the Academy Award for Best Picture, enters the public domain this year.', NULL, 0),

