(4542, 'Aanandi Joshi is an Indian playback singer who predominantly sings for Marathi films. She has received several awards, including a Filmfare Award Marathi, two Zee Chitra Gaurav Puraskar and a Maharashtra State Film Award for the best female playback singer.', NULL, 0),
(4543, 'Thiruvizha Jayashankar (born 1940) is an Indian classical musician and a well known nadaswaram expert in South India.', '1940-01-01', 0),
(4544, NULL, NULL, 0),
(4545, 'Mark Raymond King (born 20 October 1958) is an English musician. He is the lead singer and bassist of the jazz-funk band Level 42. King is known for his slap style of playing the bass guitar, with MusicRadar describing him as "the guy who put the slap in pop during the 80s". King received a BASCA Gold Badge Award in October 2015 in recognition of his contribution to British music. He won the "Outer Limits" award at the 2017 Progressive Music Awards.', '1958-10-20', 0),
