(4918, 'Neelkamal Singh Kushwaha is an Indian singer. He is a well established singer in the Bhojpuri music industry. In December 2022, his song Judai is said to have gained more viewership, leaving behind the Lal Ghagra of Pawan Singh for a long period of time after release, which led to his inclusion among the notable Bhojpuri singers of the industry. A resident of Buxar, Bihar, Singh started his career in 2003. He was one of the participant in the music reality show Sur Sangram, where he was eliminated after reaching the top four. According to media reports, his networth is somewhere around 140 million.', NULL, 0),
