Some of their best-known works are Don, Bairaag, Saraswatichandra, Qurbani, Muqaddar Ka Sikandar, Laawaris, Tridev, and Safar. They won the 1975 Filmfare Award for Best Music Director for Kora Kagaz.', '1933-03-02', 0),
