(4954, '"Sapphire" is a song by English singer-songwriter Ed Sheeran. It was released on 5 June 2025 as the third single from Sheeran''s upcoming eighth studio album, Play, through Gingerbread Man Records and Atlantic Records. The track marks Sheeran''s first collaboration with Indian artist, Arijit Singh, and is noted for its blend of Western pop and Indian – specifically Punjabi – musical influences. "Sapphire" peaked at number five on the UK Singles Chart, becoming Sheeran''s 43rd top 10 hit in his home country.', NULL, 0),
