(5257, 'Waqar Ali (Urdu: وقار علی, born 16 January 1966) is a Pakistani musician and singer. Ali has produced many albums and singles for the Pakistan film industry.  His father is the classical singer Shafqat Hussein, and Waqar Ali often works with his elder brother Sajjad Ali.  Ali composed the 1998 film Aik Aur Love Story and is the composer of the 2007 Pakistani TV drama series Sill.
He has worked with singers Rahat Fateh Ali Khan, Sajjad Ali, Shabnam Majeed, Atif Aslam, Lucky Ali, Qurat-ul-Ain Balouch and others. For over more than the two recent most decades, Waqar Ali has evolved into one of the best TV music composers in Pakistan.', '1966-01-16', 0),
