(5563, 'Kamran Rashid Khan, known professionally as Lazarus, is a Detroit-based American rapper, songwriter and physician of Pakistani descent. He is known for his singles "GODFLOW", "Break the Walls" and "Man on a Mission" along with his songs "Drug of Choice", "Open Heart Surgery", "Underdog", "MTBK" and "Decapitation Chamber" featuring Nusrat Fateh Ali Khan, Bizarre, Royce da 5''9", Bohemia and Ghostface Killah respectively.

', NULL, 0),
(5564, 'Lehmber Hussainpuri (pronounced [lǽmbər husɛːnpuri], born 17 July 1977) is an Indian Bhangra singer.', '1977-07-17', 0),
