(5653, 'Baljit Singh Padam, better known by Dr. Zeus, is a British composer, singer and producer of Punjabi music who has also worked in Indian films. He rose to fame in 2003 with his song "Kangna", which was voted the best song on BBC Asian Network in the same year. His other hits are "Don''t Be Shy" and "Jugni Ji". He has collaborated with singer Kanika Kapoor for the song "Jugni Ji" and with musician Jaz Dhami for the song "Zulfa". His song "Aag Ka Dariya" features on the Four Lions film soundtrack. A music video was also produced featuring model Yana Gupta and singers Ravindra & DJ Shortie. In 2017 he collaborated with Snoop Dogg and Nargis Fakhri for Woofer.', NULL, 0),
