(5664, 'Louisa Johnson (born 11 January 1998) is an English singer. In 2015, she won the twelfth series of The X Factor. She subsequently released her winner''s single "Forever Young", which peaked at number nine on the UK Singles Chart. In 2016, she was featured on Clean Bandit''s UK top five single "Tears".', '1998-01-11', 0),
