(6046, 'Anitha Kuppusamy is a Tamil folk and Carnatic singer, and television host known for her ''Naatupura Pattu'', a Tamil folk art. Anitha aspired to become a singer from a young age. Apart from singing, Anitha has appeared as a judge on several television reality shows. Anitha has written few books on cookery and appeared in cookery shows on TV.', NULL, 0),

