(6072, 'Manpreet Singh, professionally known as Singga, is an Indian singer, songwriter, actor, rapper, lyricist, composer, producer and Director associated with Punjabi Music and Punjabi cinema. He is best known for his bollywood songs "Badnam", "Sheh", "Shadow", "Photo", "Jatt Di Clip 2" and "Brotherhood" in punjabi music industry. He made his acting debut with bollywood movie, Jora: The Second Chapter in film industry.

