(6301, 'MILI also professionally known as Mili Nair (born on 7 April), is singer, songwriter, composer from India. 
She released her debut album, Written In The Stars, which featured Vinnie Colaiuta on drums, Michael Landau on guitar, James Genus on bass, and George Whitty on piano/keys. She wrote and composed all the songs on the album.', NULL, 0),

