(6666, 'Rakshita Suresh (born 1 june 1998) is one of the upcoming leading Indian playback singers known for her work in Tamil, Hindi, Kannada, Telugu and Malayalam cinema. She was the winner on Rhythm Tadheem aired on ETV Kannada and title winner of "Little Star Singer" 2009 aired on Asianet Suvarna (Kannada). She is the first runner up in the reality show of Super Singer 6 aired on Star Vijay (Tamil) in 2018.', '1998-06-01', 0),
