(7642, 'Pratima Bandopadhyay (Bengali: প্রতিমা বন্দ্যোপাধ্যায়, 21 December 1934 – 29 July 2004, born as Pratima Chatterjee aka Pratima Chattopadhyay) was a Bengali playback singer from Kolkata, who sang numerous songs in popular Bengali language movies and non-film as well, particularly during the 1940s, 50s, 60s and 70s. She was also known as Pratima Banerjee.', NULL, 0),
