He is known for his songs with notable Punjabi Singers - Manmohan Waris, Kamal Heer, Nachhatar Gill, Roshan Prince, Deep Dhillon, Mannat Noor, Miss Pooja, Lakhwinder Wadali & Ravinder Grewal. He rose to fame with Ravinder Grewal''s Blockbuster Song - Lovely V/s PU.', NULL, 0),
