(7685, 'Sashi Preetam is an Indian film composer and singer who primarily works in Telugu cinema. He rose to fame as a composer with the film Gulabi (1995), which became a major musical hit. He has composed background scores for many Telugu and Hindi films. In June 2020, he suffered a heart attack and recovered after surgery.

', NULL, 0),

