(7795, 'Priyanka Singh (born 9 May 1990) is an Indian playback singer and performer who is mainly active in Bhojpuri and Hindi cinema. She made her singing debut on the reality show Sur Sangram Season - 1, broadcast on Mahua Channel. She has sung more than two thousand songs in Bhojpuri, Hindi and Assamese.', '1990-05-09', 0),
