The Telangana Government announced a cash reward of Rs.1 crore to Rahul Sipligunj who got international recognition with the Oscar award winning song ''Naatu Naatu'' in RRR on 20 July 2025.

', '1989-08-22', 0),
(8057, 'Rahul Ranade (born 23 May 1966) is a music composer. His work in music spans from composing music for films, television, drama to events, concerts, composing music for ballets, advertisements, and also albums.', '1966-05-23', 0),
