(8065, 'Rahul Sharma (born 25 September 1972) is an Indian classical santoor player and composer. He has released numerous albums throughout his career, several of which have been collaborations with prominent artists such as his father, Shivkumar Sharma, Richard Clayderman, Deep Forest, and Kenny G.', '1972-09-25', 0),
