(8120, 'Altaf Raja (born 15 October 1967) is an Indian Qawwali singer.  In 1997 Altaf gained recognition with his debut album Tum To Thehre Pardesi. His most recent song is Ae Sanam. He uses urdu shayari in his Songs.', '1967-10-15', 0),
(8121, 'Rubayyat Jahan (Bengali: রুবায়াত জাহান, born 26 February 1979) is a Bangladeshi-born British singer.', '1979-02-26', 0),
