(8625, 'Himani Kapoor is an Indian singer and finalist of Sa Re Ga Ma Pa Challenge 2005. She hosted a show with Karan Oberoi on Zee TV called "Antakshari". She also competed in Star Plus''s Jo Jeeta Wohi Superstar. She gained wider recognition for singing  "Thode Kam Ajnabi" in Pagglait composed by Arijit Singh.', NULL, 0),
(8626, 'Hirdesh "Honey" Singh (born 15 March 1983), known professionally as Yo Yo Honey Singh, is an Indian singer and music producer. He commenced his career as a hip-hop music producer in 2003, working as a session and recording artist within the underground music scene until the release of his debut studio album, International Villager.', '1983-03-15', 0),
