(8924, 'Kuwar Virk (born 27 july 1991) is an Indian music director, singer, rapper, and songwriter from Delhi, India. He made his debut as a rap artist in the year 2010 as D-Rap Blaster. His first commercial track was Nakhra featuring Mika Singh, Kaptan Laddi which was released in 2014. He made a major entry in Bollywood as a singer with song "Malamaal" from movie Housefull 3.', '1991-07-27', 0),
(8925, 'Wiktor Jakowski (born 18 July 1999), better known by the stage name Kinny Zimmer, is a Polish rapper, singer, songwriter and producer.', '1999-07-18', 0),
