Wajid Khan, the younger of the two brothers, died on June 1, 2020.', NULL, 0),
(9100, 'Sajjad Ali (born 1966) is a Pakistani semi-classical, pop and rock singer, poet, actor, film director as well as a film producer from Karachi, Pakistan.', '1966-01-01', 0),
(9101, 'Sajjad Ali (born 1966) is a Pakistani semi-classical, pop and rock singer, poet, actor, film director as well as a film producer from Karachi, Pakistan.', '1966-01-01', 0),
