He recorded songs for over a thousand Hindi films and in many Indian languages as well as some foreign languages, though primarily in', '1924-12-24', 0),
(9364, 'Sapna Awasthi Singh is a Bollywood playback singer best known for her "Banno Teri Ankhiyan Soorme" from Dushmani (1995), "Pardesi Pardesi" from Raja Hindustani (1996), "Chaiyya Chaiyya" from Dil Se.. (1998), "Angoori Badan" from Jaanwar (1998) and "UP Bihar Lootne" from Shool (1999).', NULL, 0),

