(9378, 'Adam Baldwin (born July 30, 1986) is a Canadian indie rock singer-songwriter based in Dartmouth, Nova Scotia. In addition to his solo work, Baldwin currently supporting fellow Atlantic Canadian singer Alan Doyle.', '1986-07-30', 0),
(9379, 'Sarai Givaty-Luboschits (Hebrew: שרי גבעתי, (1982-06-24)June 24, 1982) is an Israeli actress, singer-songwriter, and model. As a musician, she is also known by her stage name ESH.', NULL, 0),
