For Indian music families, see List of Indian music families.', NULL, 0),
(9642, 'Tamasha (Urdu: تماشا, transl. "spectacle" or "drama"), also known as Tamasha Ghar, is a Pakistani Urdu-language television reality show which airs on ARY Digital in Pakistan. It adheres to the popular format of Big Brother, which was first developed by Endemol and Banijay in the Netherlands. The Pakistani version has celebrities as housemates.', NULL, 0),
(9643, NULL, NULL, 0),
