(10079, 'Himani Kapoor is an Indian singer and finalist of Sa Re Ga Ma Pa Challenge 2005. She hosted a show with Karan Oberoi on Zee TV called "Antakshari". She also competed in Star Plus''s Jo Jeeta Wohi Superstar. She gained wider recognition for singing  "Thode Kam Ajnabi" in Pagglait composed by Arijit Singh.', NULL, 0),
