(10639, 'Shah is a popular surname in India, Nepal, Bangladesh, and Pakistan.
Shah (, Persian: شاه, romanized: Šāh, pronounced [ʃɒːh], ''king'') is a title given to the emperors, kings, princes and lords of Iran (historically known as Persia in the West).', NULL, 0),
