(11016, 'Amanjot Singh Panwar known by his stage name Alfaaz, is an Indian singer, lyricist and writer from Chandigarh, Punjab. Alfaaz was also a former member of Mafia Mundeer, a platform pioneered by Yo Yo Honey Singh.', NULL, 0),
