(11334, 'M. M. Manasi is an Indian playback singer trained in Hindustani vocals and also dubbing artist. She has sung more than 170 songs in Tamil, Telugu, Kannada, Malayalam, Hindi, and English. Her hits in Tamil are "Stylish Thamizachi" in Aarambam, "Kattikeda" in Kaaki Sattai, "Semma Mass" in Massu, "Robo Romeo" in Tamizhuku En Ondrai Azhuthavum, "Sottavaala" in Puli, "Aatakari Maman Ponnu" in Ilayaraja''s 1000th film Tharai Thappattai and "Ranjithame" in Varisu.
She won the SIIMA Award for Best Female Playback Singer (Telugu) for ''''Rangamma Mangamma'''' from the 2018 Tollywood periodic-drama film Rangasthalam.', NULL, 0),
