(11825, 'This article lists notable families whose members are prominent in the Indian film industry.
This list also includes a select number of South Indian film families who crossed over into Hindi cinema. For a full list, see List of South Indian film families.
For Indian music families, see List of Indian music families.', NULL, 0),
(11826, 'Anita Louise Lane (18 March 1960 – 27 April 2021) was an Australian singer-songwriter who was briefly a member of the Bad Seeds with Nick Cave and Mick Harvey and collaborated with both bandmates. Lane released two solo albums, Dirty Pearl (1993) and Sex O''Clock (2001).', '1960-03-18', 0),
