(11835, 'Jasdeep Singh Gill (born 26 November 1988) is an Indian singer, live performer and actor associated with Punjabi and Hindi language music and films. He debuted in Punjabi cinema with the 2014 film Mr & Mrs 420 and in Hindi cinema with the 2018 film Happy Phirr Bhag Jayegi.', '1988-11-26', 0),
(11836, 'Gurnam Bhullar (born 8 February 1994) is an Indian singer, actor and lyricist associated with Punjabi language music and films. He is best known for his single Diamond released in 2018. He made his debut in the 2019 film Guddiyan Patole.', '1994-02-08', 0),
