(12355, 'Narendra Biyogi (Nepali:नरेन्द्र वियोगी, born September 9, 1986) is a songwriter, musician, and music arranger from the Pyuthan district of Nepal. Biyogi is best known for the arrangement of Parkha Parkha Mayalu and Pirim Nalaune.', '1986-09-09', 0),
